---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import WaveDivider from '../components/WaveDivider.astro';
import BookCta from '../components/BookCta.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

/**
 * My story — §8: "founder photo, Caveat-heavy".
 *
 * Written in first person because Sunnyside is one person, working from a
 * home studio in West Jordan. The copy is edited from the owner's own account
 * (2026-11-18): the go-to friend for brows and makeup, Skinworks in Salt Lake
 * City with honors, a home studio on purpose, and a belief in energy and the
 * nervous-system reset. Keep it in §11's voice — plain verbs, no ban-list words.
 *
 * The portrait is the owner, photographed in a high-desert field (2026-11-18).
 */
const PORTRAIT = '/img/story-portrait.webp';
---

<Page
  title="My story — Sunnyside Spa"
  description="Sunnyside Spa is a home studio in West Jordan, Utah — facials, brows, lashes and waxing, one person at a time."
  eyebrow="My story"
  heading="Just you and me"
  lede="Sunnyside is a quiet room in my home in West Jordan. No front desk, no clinic lights, no one in the next chair."
  mark="logomark"
>
  <section class="st">
    <div class="shell st__intro">
      <Figure
        class="st__portrait reveal"
        shape="arch"
        ratio="4 / 5"
        src={PORTRAIT}
        alt="Standing in a field of dry golden grass under a soft overcast sky, snow on the mountains behind, glancing over one shoulder with a small smile, in a cream floral slip dress."
        loading="eager"
      />

      <div class="st__copy reveal">
        <p class="t-quote t-quote--tilt st__pull">I wanted somewhere that felt like a friend's house.</p>

        <p class="t-body">
          Before a wedding, a big night or a first date, I was the one friends
          and family called to wax their brows or do their makeup. Training properly felt
          like the natural next step, so I studied esthetics at Skinworks in
          Salt Lake City and graduated with honors.
        </p>

        <p class="t-body">
          Beauty techniques have fascinated me for as long as I can remember,
          and I genuinely love this work.
        </p>

        <p class="t-body">
          I work from home on purpose. A treatment lands differently when it
          doesn't feel clinical: no waiting room, no rush, nobody on the other
          side of a curtain. Just you, me, and an hour that belongs to you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Safety is the big point (owner's request, 2026-11-18): a chiffon panel
        between the story and the beliefs, not a line buried in a paragraph. */}
    <div class="shell">
      <section class="st__safe grain reveal" aria-labelledby="st-safe">
        <div class="st__safe-head">
          <p class="t-eyebrow">Safety first</p>
          <h2 class="t-display st__safe-title" id="st-safe">You're in safe hands</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="st__safe-body">
          <p class="t-body">
            I am meticulous about the details, and about your safety most of
            all. I am a Utah licensed and insured esthetician. I went to great lengths to have Sunnyside approved by the
            State of Utah, and the health department has inspected the studio.
            I know this work deeply, and I'm always happy to explain what I'm
            doing and why, so you can stop wondering and simply rest.
          </p>
          <ul class="st__proof" role="list">
            <li class="t-h3">Utah licensed and insured esthetician</li>
            <li class="t-h3">Approved by the State of Utah</li>
            <li class="t-h3">Inspected by the health department</li>
            <li class="t-h3">Skinworks graduate, with honors</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="shell"><WaveDivider size="full" /></div>

    <div class="shell st__cols">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="t-h2">More than skin deep</h2>
        <p class="t-body">
          Whatever you book, a facial, a lash lift or a quick brow tidy, it is
          never only about the mirror. I care about the energy you walk in with,
          and the energy you leave with. A quiet room
          and unhurried hands give your nervous system the chance to reset, and
          when your body settles, your mind follows and your skin shows it.
          There is real science behind that, and you deserve to feel it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="t-h2">Your time here</h2>
        <p class="t-body">
          We start by talking about what you want. I tell you plainly what I
          would suggest, and nothing gets added without asking you first. Then
          you lie back, breathe out, and let the next hour be the quiet part
          of your week.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="shell"><WaveDivider /></div>

    <div class="shell st__close reveal">
      <p class="st__mark" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="you-time" size={36} /></p>
      <p class="t-quote st__pull">Come as you are, leave more you.</p>
      <p class="t-body st__note">
        Sunnyside Spa · {SITE.city}, UT
      </p>
      <BookCta />
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .st { padding-block: var(--space-2xl); }

  .st__intro {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .st__copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md); }

  /* Caveat-heavy (§8), but still only a few moments per page (§4). */
  .st__pull { --quote-color: var(--rose-deep); }

  .st__safe {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-block: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl);
    padding: clamp(var(--space-xl), 6vw, var(--space-3xl));
    border-radius: var(--r-card);
    background-color: var(--surface-soft);
  }

  .st__safe-head { display: grid; gap: var(--space-sm); align-content: start; }
  .st__safe-head .t-eyebrow { --eyebrow-color: var(--rose-deep); }
  .st__safe-title { margin: 0; }
  .st__safe-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-lg); }

  .st__proof { display: grid; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--line-hair); }
  .st__proof li {
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-sm);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--line-hair);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .st__cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .st__cols h2 { margin-block-end: var(--space-md); }

  .st__close {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .st__mark { margin: 0; color: var(--dusty-rose); }

  .st__note { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .st__intro {
      grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
      gap: clamp(var(--space-xl), 6vw, var(--space-3xl));
    }
    .st__copy { padding-block-start: var(--space-lg); }
    .st__safe { grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: clamp(var(--space-xl), 6vw, var(--space-3xl)); }
    .st__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(var(--space-xl), 6vw, var(--space-3xl)); }
  }
</style>
